      "message": "I agree with both.  In the next PS, I added hover functionality.  But also, I do want to be able to mouse into the popover to copy text.  That\u0027s another problem we had with the status page.  That gets better in later versions of patternfly-react.  For now, I did a slightly hacky thing where if you click twice it gets pinned.  That\u0027s not very discoverable, but maybe it\u0027s good enough for a little while.\n\nRegarding animation -- I think that could be useful, but there\u0027s a chance that in many or most cases we just end up with a line or throbbing blue squares which may not be helpful.  I think I\u0027d like to see what happens with static colors first.  So maybe let\u0027s consider that as another change.",
